sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Operator
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>(TLS Termination)
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend<br/>8000/TCP
    participant Ollama as Ollama LLM<br/>11434/TCP HTTP
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI API<br/>HTTPS
    participant VertexAI as Vertex AI (Claude)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>HTTPS

    Note over User, HFHub: Deployment Planning Flow

    User->>Route: HTTPS Request
    Route->>UI: HTTP/8501 (TLS terminated)
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/extract-intent<br/>HTTP/8000

    alt LLM_PROVIDER=ollama (default)
        Backend->>Ollama: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/11434 (no encryption)
        Ollama-->>Backend: Intent extraction result
    else LLM_PROVIDER=openai
        Backend->>OpenAI: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS, API Key auth
        OpenAI-->>Backend: Intent extraction result
    else LLM_PROVIDER=vertex
        Backend->>VertexAI: POST /v1/messages<br/>HTTPS/443, GCP credentials
        VertexAI-->>Backend: Intent extraction result
    end

    Backend-->>UI: Extracted intent JSON
    UI-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: HTTPS Response

    Note over User, HFHub: GPU Detection & Capacity Planning Flow

    User->>Route: HTTPS Request
    Route->>Backend: GET /api/v1/gpu-types<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>K8sAPI: List Nodes<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Node list with nvidia.com/gpu.product labels
    Note over Backend: Cache GPU types (TTL: 300s)
    Backend-->>Route: Available GPU types
    Route-->>User: GPU types JSON

    User->>Route: HTTPS Request
    Route->>Backend: POST /api/v1/calculate<br/>HTTP/8000 (capacity request)
    Backend->>Backend: Query benchmark database
    Backend-->>Route: Capacity plan result
    Route-->>User: Deployment recommendations

    Note over User, HFHub: Deployment Generation Flow

    User->>Route: HTTPS Request
    Route->>Backend: POST /api/v1/generate-deployment<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>Backend: Generate K8s manifests
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Apply manifests<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Deployment created
    Backend-->>Route: Deployment status
    Route-->>User: Deployment confirmation

    Note over User, HFHub: Model Info Flow

    User->>Route: HTTPS Request
    Route->>Backend: POST /api/v1/model-info<br/>HTTP/8000
    Backend->>HFHub: GET model metadata<br/>HTTPS, HF_TOKEN
    HFHub-->>Backend: Model card & config
    Backend-->>Route: Model information
    Route-->>User: Model details JSON

    Note over User, HFHub: Database Admin Flow (Optional HMAC Auth)

    User->>Route: HTTPS Request
    Route->>Backend: POST /api/v1/db/upload-benchmarks<br/>HTTP/8000<br/>Header: X-Admin-Password
    Backend->>Backend: Verify HMAC password<br/>(if DB_ADMIN_PASSWORD set)
    Backend->>Backend: Update benchmark database
    Backend-->>Route: Upload result
    Route-->>User: Admin operation result
